sition finance credit facilities; commercial real estate loans; residential mortgages; and other consumer loans. The company offers loan servicing and deposit transaction processing systems, cloud-based data storage, electronic funds transfer transaction processing, online banking services, ERP systems and computer and networking infrastructure. It operates through a network of banking centers located in Florida counties and the New York metropolitan area, as well as Dallas, Texas. The company was formerly known as BU Financial Corporation. BankUnited, Inc. was incorporated in 2009 and is headquartered in Miami Lakes, Florida.","ceo_bio":"Mr. Rajinder P. Singh | Chairman, President & CEO | Age 54 | Compensation: $4.4M (FY2025)","culture_narrative":"Employs approximately 1K people. Revenue per employee of $612K ranks in the above the sector median among Financial Services peers. Stock-based compensation of $11K per employee reflects an ownership culture. CEO compensation is 7\u00d7 revenue per employee (modest relative to workforce productivity). Governance score flags moderate compensation governance risk (4/10).","financial_summary":["BankUnited, Inc. is a mid-cap financial services business with a $3.1B market cap on $1.1B of annual revenue.","The top line has compounded at +3% over the past three years and +3% annually across the full decade, which puts it in mature, slow-growth territory.","Returns on capital run at 9% against a 10% cost of capital, which means the business is destroying value with every dollar it reinvests.","On the balance sheet, leverage is comfortably conservative at 0.2\u00d7 net debt/EBITDA, and thin 0.4\u00d7 interest coverage leaves no room for a bad year.","Shareholder yield of 4.4% reflects a genuine commitment to returning capital rather than empire-building, and insider ownership is negligible, so management has little personal stake in the long-term outcome."],"sector_headwinds":[{"text":"Altman Z in the distress zone (0.2) \u2014 the kind of balance-sheet risk that can make a loss permanent","sev":"red","cat":"quality"},{"text":"Price sits 22% above estimated fair value \u2014 no margin of safety left","sev":"amber","cat":"valuation","magnitude":0.21526113238034864},{"text":"Above-average short interest at 8.1% of float","sev":"amber","cat":"sentiment"},{"text":"Credit cycles and regulatory capital \u2014 losses accumulate invisibly in good years and appear all at once, and the time to worry is when underwriting standards are loosest.","sev":"amber","cat":"thesis_risk"},{"text":"Fintech disintermediation \u2014 neobanks, embedded finance, and blockchain rails are unbundling the fee streams that traditional banks took for granted.","sev":"amber","cat":"thesis_risk"},{"text":"Interest rate regime shifts \u2014 a rapid move in rates can invert the yield curve, crush bond portfolios, and trigger deposit flight simultaneously.","sev":"amber","cat":"thesis_risk"}],"sector_tailwinds":["Piotroski score 7/9 \u2014 financials improving across profitability, leverage and efficiency","15 consecutive years of dividend payments \u2014 an operating record that makes the dividend claim credible","Healthy payout ratio leaves room for both dividend growth and reinvestment","Financial quality scores above most Financial Services peers"],"news_headlines":[{"title":"BankUnited (BKU) Following HoldCo Pressure, Is The Stock Fully Valued Or Still A Bargain?","source":"simplywall.st","link":"https://simplywall.st/stocks/us/banks/nyse-bku/bankunited/news/bankunited-bku-following-holdco-pressure-is-the-stock-fully","date":"2026-11-11","timestamp":1794372449.09,"origin":"tiingo","sentiment":0.924,"tier":0,"scope":"company","tags":[]},{"title":"Responsive Playbooks and the BKU Inflection","source":"news.stocktradersdaily.com","link":"https://news.stocktradersdaily.com/news_release/101/Responsive_Playbooks_and_the_BKU_Inflection_111026044202_1794303722.html","date":"2026-11-10","timestamp":1794303722.0,"origin":"tiingo","